                    'When a table frees up, tap WhatsApp or Call, then Seat: tap a free table and the order opens with the party size as covers and their name and phone filled in',
                    'WhatsApp opens WhatsApp on this device with a table-ready message filled in, sent from your own phone; nothing goes out by itself. Leave the phone empty for a party waiting at the door',
